      "text": "Applicants can now pay USCIS fees by ACH debit. Simply complete and sign our new Form G-1650, Authorization for ACH Transactions, and place the form on top of your application, petition, or request when you file.\n\nWe will continue to accept paper checks, money orders, and credit and debit transactions until Oct. 28, 2025. Starting Oct. 28, we will accept only ACH debit transactions using Form G-1650 or credit card payments using Form G-1450, Authorization for Credit Card Transactions.\n\nTo learn more, visit https://t.co/EkRIPuk1tW",
